# Build context for apps/web/Dockerfile (context = repository root).
# Keep the context minimal so secrets, caches, and unrelated services never reach an image layer.
.git
.github
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
apps/api
docs
ops
tools
*.md
